    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d141">

                <pb facs="0214" n="138" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg138"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1707</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Reinsch to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-09-15T19:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 15, 1916, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Minister of Finance states that he has authorized Minister Koo to negotiate with
                    western bankers and hopes that the Department will take a favorable attitude
                    toward eventual loan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
